// QNMF Ablation: No-P3 (Optimal Transport / Sparse Routing Disabled)
// Base architecture with P1 State, P2 Memory, P4 World Model, P6 ECRA Controller
// Top-k / Sinkhorn routing bypassed with dense uniform feedforward pass

network QNMFAblationP3 ⟦
    dense ⟬128⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 2048⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬2048⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 128⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "QNMF_ABLATION_P3_NO_ROUTING_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
